@startuml
 title Целевая компонентная диаграмма Request System
 left to right direction
 skinparam componentStyle uml2
 skinparam packageStyle rectangle

 note top
   Целевая схема, а не перечень уже реализованных компонентов.
   Один предметный модуль не обязан иметь отдельную пару
   controller/service/repository.
 end note

 package "Presentation" as presentation {
   component "CLI adapter\nimplemented placeholder" as cli
   component "RequestController\nplanned" as controller
 }

 package "Application / domain" as application {
   component "RequestService\nplanned use cases" as service
   component "Domain model\nUser · Request · Status\nCategory · Comment" as model
 }

 package "Repository ports" as ports {
   interface "RequestRepository\nrequest + status history + comments" as request_repo
   interface "UserRepository" as user_repo
   interface "CategoryRepository" as category_repo
 }

 package "Infrastructure" as infrastructure {
   component "Persistence adapter\nplanned; technology TBD" as adapter
   database "Database\nplanned; technology TBD" as db
 }

 cli --> controller : future commands
 controller --> service : runtime call
 service --> request_repo : runtime call
 service ..> user_repo : if use case needs it
 service ..> category_repo : if use case needs it
 adapter ..|> request_repo : implements port
 adapter ..|> user_repo : implements port
 adapter ..|> category_repo : implements port
 adapter --> db : runtime I/O
 service ..> model : uses

 note bottom of adapter
   Adapter depends on repository abstractions;
   service does not import infrastructure.
 end note
@enduml
